19 0 obj
<< /A 52 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating a plant leaf disease classification pipeline: input leaf image undergoes preprocessing, feature extraction via ConvNext-Base and GeM, then classification using linear, normalization, and dropout layers, finally outputting labels healthy or diseased. The ConvNext-Base block is detailed in four stages with downsampling and multiple ConvNext blocks per stage.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
20 0 obj
<< /A 53 0 R /Alt (Grid of eight photographic images shows individual plant leaves, each labeled with ground truth and predicted classifications for species and health status, including categories such as healthy, bacterial spot, citrus greening, spider mites, and leaf spot.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 39 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
21 0 obj
<< /A 54 0 R /Alt (Eight plant leaf photos arranged in a grid, each with a label indicating ground truth and predicted class. Leaves depicted include bell pepper, tomato, grape, strawberry, corn, and blueberry, with some showing spots or blight while others appear healthy.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 40 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
22 0 obj
<< /A 55 0 R /Alt (Line chart comparing training loss and validation loss over thirty epochs, with both losses decreasing and converging near zero. Validation loss shows a temporary increase around epochs five to ten.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 42 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
23 0 obj
<< /A 56 0 R /Alt (Line graph comparing training loss and validation loss over thirty epochs. Both losses decrease rapidly at first, stabilizing after ten epochs, with training loss consistently lower than validation loss throughout the graph.) /K 1 /P 9 0 R /Pg 42 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
24 0 obj
<< /A 57 0 R /Alt (Confusion matrix heatmap for PlantVillage dataset displaying true versus predicted labels across plant disease and health categories, with most values concentrated on the diagonal, indicating high classification accuracy, and a blue gradient colorbar representing value intensity from zero to one hundred.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 44 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
25 0 obj
<< /A 58 0 R /Alt (Confusion matrix for PlantDoc dataset displayed as a heatmap, with plant leaf disease classes on both axes. Most predictions align perfectly with true labels, indicated by diagonal dark green squares labeled one hundred, except lower accuracy for Potato_leaf_early_blight and Tomato_leaf_yellow_virus, which each show fifty percent.) /K 0 /P 9 0 R /Pg 45 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
